# pipenv
# According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
# However, if you are using pipenv with a lock file and want to keep it out of VCS, uncomment the line below.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
# Similar to Pipenv, it is recommended to keep poetry.lock out of version control.
# However, for dependency management, we want to keep it in version control for reproducibility.
# poetry.lock

